window.products.push({"id":1039135,"name":"Master Class Canele Moulds with PFOA Free Non Stick, Robust 1 mm Carbon Steel, 9 Hole 32.5 x 22 cm Baking Tin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.92,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+dAdTSz4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The highly durable Master Class Non-Stick 9-Hole Canelé Mould / Tin is built to bake batch after batch of this delicious French treat. With its commercial grade, 1 mm-thick carbon steel construction and Quantum II double non-stick coating, it has everything you need to achieve the perfect Canelé recipe – with soft, moist centres, perfectly caramelised crusts, and no burnt-on bits! The tray measures 32.5 x 22 cm (13” x 8½”) and features nine 5 cm x 5.5 cm (2”) holes, making it ideal for baking treats to serve with afternoon tea or to impress guests at a dinner party. A Master Class in Baking Performance This canelé pan is made of heavy-duty 1 mm-thick electroplated carbon steel with rolled edges. This extra-thick, warp and rust-resistant design means it delivers high-performance results, day after day. In other words, you can cook with confidence – use as directed, and your canelés will come out perfectly shaped, with a consistent bake and lovely texture. The pan is coated with the innovative, non-stick Quantum II finish, which is designed to outlast all conventional non-sticks. Its outstanding quick-release properties mean you can remove your canelés really easily without damaging them. This double-layered coating is applied to a sandblasted base for a greater level of adhesion. And because it uses silicone, not PTFE, for its non-stick effect, it’s a safer choice too. Useful Information — Always PTFE, PFOA and BPA free!  — Really simple to clean, thanks to its Quantum II coating — Sandblasted for extra durability  — Fridge and freezer safe — Oven safe to 220 degrees Celsius (428 degrees Celsius)  — Comes with Master Class’s 20 year guarantee and 5 year non-stick guarantee The Master Class Bakeware Collection Bake a perfect spread of canelés with the award-winning* Master Class Bakeware range. Why not combine your canelé pan with the non-stick friand pan (KCMCHB88), éclair pan (KCMCHB81), or mini madeleine pan (KCMCHB92) today? *Winner of Housewares Magazine's Bakeware Best of Best Sellers 2014 and 2013 Set Contains: 1 x Master Class 9-Hole Non-Stick Canelé Mould / Baking Tin, 32.5 x 22 cm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+dAdTSz4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Master Class","source_asin":"B00GGLIQGW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1039135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GGLIQGW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GGLIQGW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
