window.products.push({"id":1039275,"name":"Beatles Collectible Vox Amp Model Replica","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KnfHgZpLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Vox Miniature Amp - Vintage England Style Ornamental Amplifier Replica Model- GEORGE HARRISON MINI GUITAR NOT INCLUDED - But can be found in our store! This handcrafted vintage-style amplifier* replica collectible is precisely proportionate to our 1:4 scale miniature guitars. This guitar amp would be perfect for the Beatles fan creating their miniature model collection diorama! The detail includes metal wire mesh front, mahogany-built amp box, knobs, speaker detail, and much more. These miniature 1:4 replica collectible amplifiers make a great addition to any miniature guitar replica collection. * These are non-functioning models. ** George Harrison's Rosewood Hollow body shown in picture, but not included. AXE HEAVEN Ornamental Miniature Replica Amps Make Great Gifts! Each AXE HEAVEN ornamental replica amp is 1:4 scale and is individually handcrafted from solid wood. AXE HEAVEN Miniature Replicas Look Great But Are Not Playable","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KnfHgZpLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FanMerch","source_asin":"B07WW2LFDW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1039275","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WW2LFDW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WW2LFDW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1039276,"name":"OurWarm Galaxy Glass Rose Flower Gift for Mom, Artificial Enchanted Rose in Glass Dome, Best Gift Ideas for Women Grandma Wife Mother's Day Valentine'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717vX+3DwCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Grass 【Unique Gift for Women】: This glass rose is a romantic gift for Mother's Day, Valentine's Day, anniversaries, weddings, birthdays, and Christmas. Suitable for women at any age, bring her surprise and happiness. Use this colorful rose flower that never fade to tell her that no matter how time goes by, love is eternal. 【Eternal Rose, Forever Love】: The forever rose in glass dome ​that will never wither represents the guarding love, whether it is love, affection or friendship, it is full of infinite hope and beauty like a rainbow. It is not simply a gift, but also a promise to each other. Witness the love that has been deposited over the years and full of hope for eternal love. 【Sparkly Rose】: The colorful preserved rose is wrapped by LED string lights and perfectly stored in the glass dome. The LED string lights are powered by 3 x AAA batteries (not included in pack). From the rose to the petals falling on the base, the warm white light illuminates the entire glass dome, decorate the room while releasing a warm and romantic atmosphere, bringing the heart closer. 【Exquisite Gift Box Packaging】: Beauty and the beast rose kit is placed directly in the black exquisite packaging gift box, and the interior is reinforced and protected by foam, so you can give it directly to others. The rose glass dome can be opened, and you can put rings, cards in it , absolutely a great idea for surprise her or express your love. 【Romantic Design】: The led rose in glass dome is composed of artificial colorful rose, LED light string, glass dome and plastic base. The glass is transparent and free of impurities. The base is stable and smooth, easy to clean and can be stored forever. The glaxy rose in glass dome size: 7.8 inches height, 3.5 inches diameter, and the base is 4.3 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717vX+3DwCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OurWarm","source_asin":"B08ZHV374N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1039276","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZHV374N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZHV374N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
