window.products.push({"id":1039419,"name":"34\" Artificial Rubber Tree Plant Faux Tropical Ficus Elastica Tree for Home Office Decoration 1 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NaT45Kw+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ficus elastica is the classic Rubber Tree, Rubber Plant or India Rubber Plant. Native to India and Malaysia, elastica is among the oldest plants used as houseplants worldwide. As a houseplant, Ficus is very popular. But the Live Ficus Elastica tree is easy to die during the cold weather in winter . So we make an artificial variegated rubber tree to decorate your home and office . You will never again worry about watering or pruning with our life-like rubber plant . It will add a touch of nature to your decor all year round. Feature: ☞ No assembly required; maintenance free ☞ Rubber tree leaves appear realistic---real touch PE plastic material ☞ Variegated fake rubber plant in a grey woven pot ☞ High quality plastic trunk ☞Easy-care item for decorative purpose FAQ: Q:How do you adjust the leaves ? A:They are easily adjusted by pulling leaves down. use some force the branches straight, The leaves are connected with wire underneath the fake branches. Q:what's the size of the  tree ? A:The Tree is 34 inch High，Pot Size: H: 5.5 inch ,Weight:4.4 lb Q:what is best way to clean these ? A:Wipe clean with a soft dry cloth or a duster. Q: How real does this look? A: it looks pretty realistic , the material are PE plastic . The leaves are somewhat bendable so you're able to shape them different ways.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NaT45Kw+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WANGYANG","source_asin":"B08LKJGPMC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1039419","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LKJGPMC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LKJGPMC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
