window.products.push({"id":1039469,"name":"MyGo Container Pizza Slice To-Go Compartment Container, 9-1/4\" X 8-1/4\" X 2-1/2\", Reusable, Microwave Safe, NSF Certified, Smoke/Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OjxUEJQDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MULTIPURPOSE: MyGo Containers purpose is transporting a meal from where it is prepared to where it will be consumed, typically within a timespan that is less than a half hour. MyGo Containers are currently in use in university campus dining operations and institutional meal service programs. DISHWASHER SAFE: These reusable containers can be used in both high heat and low temp dishwashers. The durable polypropylene containers are safe for washing in a high heat machine as well as with dishwashing chemicals used with low temp washers. SPILL RESISTANT: The gasketed lid creates a spill-resistant seal and is further secured with three hinged, snap-tight tabs to keep containers tightly closed in transit. Interior compartments are sealed off, allowing entrees and sides to stay separated, even sauces and dressings. This item is spill resistant not leak proof, not intended to store water. SPACE SAVING DESIGN: These take out containers are designed to be stackable, providing a way to save space in a fridge, pantry, or cabinet. MyGo Containers are the perfect alternative to disposable styrofoam and paper carry out containers. MICROWAVE SAFE: MyGo Containers are made from 100% BPA free polypropylene, they can be used safely for reheating foods in a microwave.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OjxUEJQDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MyGo Container","source_asin":"B09NZS3KFV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1039469","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NZS3KFV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NZS3KFV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1039470,"name":"Cultural Hub Duck Tray 7\", Bowl Platter Tray Indian Royal Engraving Design with Decorative Gifting Box JK-488-107 (Swan Shaped Bowl 7\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NMjopVckL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Serve anything during a guest visit or simply keep it in your drawing room or dining table for an alluring look and to enhance the interiors of your room with this trendy and stylish showpiece. This is a beautiful brass piece, solid, durable and well made. An exquisite design and a silver hue makes this beautiful Dish a wonderful table decor item. Besides being aesthetically appealing, this Dish is long-lasting and easy to maintain too, courtesy its brass make.  Gift it or use it, it is sure to be admired by all your friends and family. A rare and exclusive collectible item with supreme quality. We are not traders. Our goal is to promote dying, inaccessible, remote art pieces of the world, so we don't lose them forever. Providing Value for money is our topmost priority considering that we are very choosy and particular for design and quality, our products are very competently priced. We make every effort to ensure that we deliver the best possible value for your hard earned money. And with our 100% customer satisfaction policy, you can rest assured that we are always there for you if you ever want to reach out to us. We believe in giving back to society/artisans: We intend to give 10% of our profits in social ventures such as providing education to the children of artisans. The endeavor is that the next generation develops the ability to directly trade with the end customer and support in rebuilding the art industry before it loses its existence. Your feedback is important to us! If you like what we do, tell the world. If you think we can do better, tell us! We do forward your feedback to the artisans and we look forward to your comments.  DISCLAIMER: This product is hand crafted. Minor variations in color, size & design are an inherent character of such products & should not be seen as defects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NMjopVckL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cultural Hub","source_asin":"B00MYV1EW6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1039470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MYV1EW6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MYV1EW6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
