window.products.push({"id":1039502,"name":"Space Saving Hangers 12 Piece for Closet Organizer Space Saver Hangers for Clothes Multi Collapsible Hangers Heavy-Duty Magic Hangers for Coat,Suit,Sw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sJ-OqlP2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👚【Hangers Space Saving】- These space saver hangers can help increase your closet space by triple and can be used for small closets and large closets.It is great for hanging shirts, skirts, suits, trousers or jackets, and even to hang heavy winter jackets, flannel shirts, sweaters is no problem.Make your wardrobe neat and orderly, and no longer worry that the wardrobe space is too small. 👚【EASY to Use-Two Hanging Ways】- This hanger organizer can be used both horizontally and vertically to maximize closet space.Place up to 8 garments on one hanger and lift one end to cascade down,saving 80% space in the closet.Make your closet neat and orderly, and no longer worry that the closet space is too small.These closet space saving hangers is the best choice for home organizations. 👚【Durable and Sturdy Magic Hangers for Closet】- Our clothes hanger is made of hardened linear stainless steel.Compared with plastic hanger, it is not easy to bend or break, and its capacity up to 50 pounds.The slots are larger than others, that bulky hangers can be used. The hooks can rotate 360 degrees freely fit a large range of closet rack rods. Rubber caps of every edging can prevent scratching of hands and clothes. 👚【Closet Organizers and Storage】- Each multi hangers - space saving closet hangers has 8 enclosed holes, different from open slots of other hangers, enclosed holes design can protect the hanger from falling.Our multi hanger can help you to store all seasons clothes in a wardrobe or small space and is a perfect closet organizer, suitable for houses, apartments, clothing malls and other small & limited space. 👚【High Responsibility After Sale Service】- Magic Hangers will become quickly a staple in many homes, college dorm room essentials, not only because they help with storage but because they make finding your favorite clothes easier than ever.We emphasizes both high quality and customer service. Any issue, please contact us. Our efficient customer service will surely offer you a satisfied solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sJ-OqlP2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"feasteery","source_asin":"B0BGS1HZJ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1039502","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGS1HZJ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGS1HZJ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
