window.products.push({"id":1039513,"name":"15 PCS Plastic Drawer Organizer Set, 4-Size Versatile Bathroom and Vanity Drawer Organizer Trays, Storage Bins for Makeup, Jewelries, Kitchen Utensils","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EuAij0lpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package Included: (9.6 L x 6.4 W x 1.9 H in)-2 PCS, (6.4 L x 6.4 W x 1.9 H in)-2 PCS, (6.4 L x 3.2 W x 1.9 H in)-5 PCS, (3.2 L x 3.2 W x 1.9 H in)-6 PCS. 4 Different Size:Can be suitable for drawers of any size.Keeping your items organized You can use it in combination at will. Organizer classification: cosmetics storage, office organizer , multi-functional kitchen drawer organizer, bathroom organizer, desk storage and finishing, dressing table organizer and finishing High Quality: The drawer organizer is made of high quality hard and clear plastic.Easy to Clean, , Transparent, BPA Free, Unbreakable, Recycled. Thicken Packing:Bubble bag & Preservative film + Three-layer thickened carton. Easy To Care:Only requires a damp warm soapy sponge or cloth for fast and effortless cleaning. Makes everything look beautiful and better organized. It will match almost any decor. Reminder:If it is damaged during transportation, don't worry, we will replace it with a new one for free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EuAij0lpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TYWJ","source_asin":"B08QRYD51D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1039513","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QRYD51D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QRYD51D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
