window.products.push({"id":1039587,"name":"3PCS Portable Wood Toothpick Holder Mini Toothpick box Pocket Toothpick Holder (Reddish Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713GhEprdTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HEALTHY WOOD MATERIAL: Using mahogany as raw material, the process is simple, and there are clear wood grain, which is made of whole piece of wood PORTABLE AND PRACTICAL: The toothpick holder is small and exquisite, Large enough to hold up to 20 toothpicks at a time, easy to carry, can be placed in bags, pockets EXQUISITE PRODUCTION: The barrel is delicately polished, round and smooth, hand-polished. Dimension of each toothpick holder is 8*1.8*1.8cm/ 3.1*0.7*0.7in WARM NOTICE: There will be some small wooden sawdust in the toothpick holder. It can be brushed clean with a brush. The outside can be wiped with a soft cloth, then wiped dry DAILY MAINTENANCE: In the winter and when the climate is dry, apply some oil-rich hand cream on the outside of the toothpick holder for maintenance. Keep away from heat and exposure","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713GhEprdTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Geilihome","source_asin":"B07R19HYZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1039587","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R19HYZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R19HYZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1039588,"name":"Multi-Purpose Non-Slip Rug & Carpet Mat Pad 23.5\" x 35.5\" for 2' x 3' rugs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IEMGa6VAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Extend the life of your floors with this Non-Slip Mat. Keep your rug(s) in place on all types of hard floors: wood, ceramic tile or linoleum. The Non-Slip Mat offers long-lasting performance, even in high-traffic areas. The slim profile is specially designed to prevent slippage. Plus, it's easily trimmed to fit ANY size rug.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IEMGa6VAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dpnamron","source_asin":"B0061Q4EG8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1039588","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0061Q4EG8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0061Q4EG8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1039589,"name":"Department 56 Snowbabies “Catching Snowflakes” Porcelain Figurine, 4.25”","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YeWPh1BZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For over 30 years, Department 56 artist Kristi Jensen Pierro has captured the beauty and splendor of winter in her classic Snowbabies collection. This Snowbaby shovels the sidewalk as sparkling snow continues to fall. A hand-knit scarf and hat keep them warm and cozy as they clear the walkway with a big, beautiful snowflake suspended above. This 4.25” porcelain scene is full of sparkle and joy. About Us: Enesco is committed to BRING JOY EVERY DAY. The premier global destination for high-quality giftware, and home décor, our prestigious family of brands includes: Department 56 Village, Gregg Gift, Foundations, Jim Shore Heartwood Creek, Disney Traditions by Jim Shore,  Disney Showcase Collection, Disney by Britto,  Designs by Lolita, Our Name Is Mud, and many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YeWPh1BZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B078YTG4RD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1039589","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078YTG4RD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078YTG4RD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1039590,"name":"RosieLily Colorful Shower Curtain, Blue Shower Curtains Set with 12 Hooks, Geometric Shower Curtain, Polka Dot Circle Firework Bathroom Decor, 72 x 72","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LDBFGqQoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ECO-Friendly & Durable Blue Shower Curatin: Made of 100% polyester, waterproof and a reinforced header that prevents tearing and ensures long-term functionality. Reinforced Bottom & Water Resistance : Reinforced top hem on the bottom prevent curtain billowing keeping the water in and the cold air out. Super water-repellent fabric is treated to let water bead stay on the surface, quick to repel and dry. Convenient & Easy Clean : Easily fits any standard size shower/tub and works with straight or curved shower rods. 12 White plastic hooks, easily change the shower curtain ring hooks to match the decor that you like. Unique Graphic Design and Standard Size for Most: The stylish blue floral shower curtain in unique print is suitable for any type of bathroom furniture. Creative and unique pattern make you enjoy your bath time. Standard 72''x72'' size fits Most. Multi-purpose, not just A shower curtain : showers and bathtubs in your home, camper, hotels, motels, dorm showers, and bathroom decor, bathroom accessories,bathroom decoration for home and more. If you like, it can be used as a light blue window curtain or as a liner for a cloth shower curtain.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LDBFGqQoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RosieLily","source_asin":"B09D2WN5KB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1039590","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D2WN5KB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D2WN5KB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1039591,"name":"Faber Floor Shine Repair - Premium Floor Polishing Cream for Scratches & Defects, Protects from Dirt - Perfect for Colored Glazed & Full Body Polished","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tfGo0UiIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PORCELAIN AS IMMACULATE AS THE DAY IT WAS LAID: Forget all about scratches and defects. Shine Repair Light is your first line of defense in maintaining light colored, glazed polished and full body polished porcelain ceramic tile, increasing the sheen, restoring slight scratches, and helping clearing up any dullness. That way, you can be sure your porcelain tiles will always look as new and shiny as they did on day one! PROTECTION AGAINST DIRT, DUST PARTICLES & MORE: More than just a floor shine product, Shine Repair Light also provides a protective layer that covers porcelain tiles and shields them from dust, dirt, and wear. Especially great for surfaces where ordinary cleaning is more difficult and less effective, this cleaning and polishing cream can really make a difference. SHOWROOM QUALITY FOR PROFESSIONAL RESULTS: When it comes to the care, treatment, and maintenance of glazed and polished porcelain tiles, there’s no room for cutting corners. Just like all other Faber products, the Unscented Faber Shine Repair Light polishing cream is formulated using nothing but the highest quality chemicals and ingredients, as well as 30+ years’ worth of specialization and expertise. DESIGNED FOR CONSTRUCTION, SHOWROOM & HOME USE: Targeted at industry professionals, craftsmen, and homeowners alike, the Faber floor tile polisher is not only easy to use – it also provides great value, as it allows you to take care of scratches and defects on your own, without breaking the bank. Plus, it is available in Light and Dark to provide the best results to your light or dark floors. GUARANTEED BY 30+ YEARS OF ITALIAN EXPERIENCE & SUCCESS: Faber has been spearheading the industry for professional chemicals for the care, treatment, and maintenance for building surfaces and natural stone since 1986. Trusted by professionals and architects all around the world, it’s a name that’s synonymous with quality and excellence – one you can trust 100%!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tfGo0UiIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FABER","source_asin":"B09GPV13SN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1039591","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GPV13SN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GPV13SN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1039592,"name":"In-Drawer Beechwood knife block, kitchen knife holder for drawer, Knife Drawer Organizer Insert - fit for 15pcs knives","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NSF5cDRUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Durable Beech Wood Material: Beechwood is stronger than bamboo, more durable and impact resistant, less prone to breakage. Our Beech Wood Knife Drawer Organizer Block, Eco friendly, high grade beech wood with excellent craftsmanship, no splinters or chips , beautifully cut, with clear lines and smooth polishing, it's a good choose for kitchen knife storage In Drawer Knife Organizer: Our beech wood in-drawer knife organizer keeps your knives perfectly arranged and prevents them from sliding around or pointing up. It keeps the blades and handles from jamming your drawer or damaging your other kitchen utensils. The drawer design keeps the knives neat and orderly, making the knives more secure and saving counter space. Functional tool & Save your kitchen space：The knife holder is pale yellow with beautiful wood grain. Fit most Standrad Kitchen Drawers- [17” Long, 9\" Wide, 2” Tall]. Perfect fit for steak knife, bread knife, chef knife and ceramic knife etc. Safely and efficiently organize kitchen knives and save space. Cleaning & Care: Hand wash with lukewarm water and mild detergent and wipe gently with a thin satin clear coat. Dry immediately after rinsing. Comparison with other knife slots: Compared with other drawer knife holders, it can be placed in the drawer to keep the countertop neat and tidy. When you are not using it, you can easily take it and organize it in the drawer, no matter how you hide it, it will not be hidden Takes up too much space. Not only can be used as a kitchen knife holder, but also as a kitchen decoration","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NSF5cDRUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"goodhelper","source_asin":"B0B424GQW9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1039592","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B424GQW9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B424GQW9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
