window.products.push({"id":1039623,"name":"EcoFresh Silicone Food Storage Bag - (Set of 6) 2 Small, 2 Med and 2 Large Reusable Kitchen Bags - Airtight Storage Bags for Lunch, Fruits, and Liquid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JM+F4I5xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"The Earth Is What We All Have In Common.” - Wendell Berry. Single-use plastic is devastating to the environment. It ends up in landfills, oceans, waterways & harms animals. One of the best ways to combat the problem is to stop using them. Every time you refuse to use a plastic bag you’re voting for a greener & richer planet. That’s why we made our reusable silicone bags easy to use, sturdy & practical, giving you an alternative that you'll love. By choosing a bag from EcoFresh, you pick one that's: 100% safe 100% safe Non-toxic Non-toxic Non-reactive Non-reactive Non-allergenic Non-allergenic Tasteless Tasteless NO BPA, BPS, PVC NO BPA, BPS, PVC No plastic, petroleum, latex or phthalates No plastic, petroleum, latex or phthalates Our bags are multipurpose making them incredibly fun! You can't tell what they’re capable of 'til you try them. Here are some examples: NEATLY ORGANIZE YOUR FRIDGE - Our airtight bags are great for keeping flavors locked in, preserving that alluring aroma & incredible taste. Stick on a label and never worry about a messy fridge. WORLD’S BEST ICE PACK - Don’t want to use a flimsy ice pack that aides in destroying our planet? Just fill up our bags with ice & throw them into the cooler. The leak-proof high-quality material holds all liquid keeping your food & drinks fresh. EASILY STORE LEFTOVERS - Have leftovers & don't have empty Tupperware to store it? Don't fret, our large bag can store up to a liter of food with no issues, minimizing the use of plastic containers. BEST FRIEND ON A RELAXING HIKE - The easiest way to be friends with nature is to not litter with single-use plastics. Load up your jerky or trail mix into our reusable bags, it's the perfect companion for long hikes. Thank you for thinking about the environment. It’s people like you that make a difference! NOTE: EcoSmrt has been changed to EcoFresh","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JM+F4I5xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ECO-FRESH","source_asin":"B07W7Q2SFL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1039623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W7Q2SFL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W7Q2SFL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
