window.products.push({"id":1039711,"name":"Wedgwood Nantucket Basket 22-Piece Dinnerware Set, Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31DT8GN18YL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Nantucket Basket by Wedgwood was inspired by the meticulous hand crafted baskets of Nantucket, Massachusetts, from the late 19th century. Made of pure white sculpted fine bone china. Nantucket Basket is perfect for casual or more formal entertaining and suitable for the dishwasher. Accessories and serving pieces also available. Amazon.com With its comfortable shaping and crisp, clean looks, Nantucket Basket dinnerware is appealingly versatile. Because its materials and craftsmanship are high quality, the pattern dresses up well, yet its styling still feels friendly enough for casual meals and celebrations. Crafted from pristine white bone china, the pattern features broad sculptural borders inspired by the handcrafted baskets created in Nantucket, Massachusetts, at the end of the 19th century. The monochromatic design is very flexible while offering enough tactile and visual interest to feel like a statement. This 22-piece set is a great starting point for a Nantucket Basket collection. It includes four place settings, each with a dinner plate, salad plate, bread and butter plate, rim soup bowl, and mug. A 13-3/4-inch serving platter and open vegetable bowl are also included, so the table is fully coordinated with a single purchase. All pieces are safe in the dishwasher with recommended detergents, and additional serveware is also available. --Emily Bedard What's in the Box 4 place settings and 2 serving pieces. Place setting includes: dinner plate; salad plate; bread and butter plate; rim soup bowl; mug. Serving set includes: 13-3/4-inch serving platter; open vegetable bowl. 22 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31DT8GN18YL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wedgwood","source_asin":"B0009MG18E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1039711","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0009MG18E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0009MG18E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
