window.products.push({"id":1039864,"name":"SOLEDI 6pcs Artificial Lavender Bouquet in Purple Flower for Bridal Home Garden Office Wedding Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mTUZsc4vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brand Introduction: Soledi: The meanning of “sole” is sun. “di” stems from the Italian suffix of Monday-lunedì, Tuesday-martedì, Wednesday-mercoledì, Thursday-giovedì, Friday-venerdì. So Soledi means everyday is sunny day with full of hope forever. The language of lavender is waiting for love, while lavender symbolizes purity, clean, protection, thanksgiving and peace. Product Specifications: Category: SOLEDI AF49 Artificial Lavender, 6 bundles in package Color: PurpleMaterial: PE foam Specification: 6 bundles of lavender Product Size：about 38cm high Package Size：40*30*8cm Single Weight: 262g Gross Weight: 272g Package: SOLEDI brand bag Package includes: SOLEDI AF49 6 bundles of purple lavender *1","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mTUZsc4vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOLEDI","source_asin":"B074NXCM7M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1039864","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074NXCM7M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074NXCM7M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1039865,"name":"Edomi Buckwheat Neck Pillow for Sleeping U Shaped Pillow Cooling Travel Head Support Pillow for Neck Pain Relief Side Sleepers Buckwheat Hulls Conceal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jclCjpauS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MATERIALS & CARE: Skin friendly fabric cover + High-quality buckwheat hulls filling. The inner pillowcase have a hidden zipper, Liner it is refillable, you can adjust the loft of your pillow by removing or adding buckwheat hulls. Remove pillow cover and liner before washing, Do not wash filling, Filling can be placed in freezer for freshening. COMFORT & RELAX: Handmade, ergonomic design. The neck Pillow has soft, breathable, comfortable fabric, moisture-wicking. Our buckwheat pillows are designed with the utmost comfort, durability, and versatility in mind. Can relieve your sleeping problems, Make you feel very comfortable. RELIEF FOR YOUR NECK: Whether your napping at home or in office our buckwheat hull pillow supports your neck and head in a position, make you more comfortable, more relax. and is great for reducing pain sleeping problems such as neck pain, muscle pain, stiff neck, headache, stress and tension. Why Choose Buckwheat Pillow: Buckwheat hulls filling have been the secret to deep, restful, and ergonomically-correct sleep. we use buckwheat hulls for our pillows because we believe they are the best! Adjust the fill level to find your ideal fullness, replace your pillow’s filling as needed unlike synthetic pillows, and enjoy the benefits of pressure-relieving neck and shoulder support. EDOMI Provide 100 Nights Free Trial for Pillows, RETURNS are FREE and EASY. if you unhappy, REACH US ! (PS: We believe you should sleep on your pillow to decide if you like it, and it can take the body least 30 nights to adjust to a new pillow.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jclCjpauS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Edomi","source_asin":"B0BM7885JV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1039865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM7885JV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM7885JV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1039866,"name":"wedrink Fathers Day Gifts 12oz Insulated Wine Tumbler with Lid and Straw Funny Wine Cup Personalized Valentines Day Christmas Gifts for Grandpa/Uncle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WNrDUXnGS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect Gifts For Mom Or Dad: Since having a child, mom & dad have become the superheroes in real life. However, even the superheros also need to recharged from time to time (We like to call it mom juice or dad fuel). This super dad wine tumbler is specially prepared for dad, father-in-law, grandfather, uncle or male friends, brother, husband as a wonderful gift on Father's Day. Buy this exquisite Wine Tumbler Gift Set to thanks and comfort them of their hard work! Gifts For Any Occasion: Whether it's birthday, holiday, Mother's day, Father's day, Christmas day, thanksgiving, anniversary, or Valentine's Day, this insulated wine tumbler cup will be an ideal gift for anyone who loves wine or coffee. Exquisite Gift Packaging: Elegant and textured leather pink/dark blue coating(Not easy to fall off or fade) outside the wine tumbler with lid will meet different clothing/occasion matching needs. Meanwhile comes with a stainless steel straw, brush, non-woven gift bag and black gift box. No need to repackage. Wonderful present! Premium Material: High grade 18/8(304) stainless steel wine tumbler body which is unbreakable, durable, rust-resistant and no-metal flavor. Upgrade BPA-FREE lid with a slide switch, which is splash-proof, straw-friendly, non-toxin absolutely and healthy. Also equipped with a silicone sleeve on the stainless steel straw that effectively protects your tooth and lips. Double Wall Vacuum Insulation: Double wall vacuum stainless steel design and copper coating layer ensure our insulated wine glass excellent performance at temperature control. Effectively keep cold juice for up to 9 hrs and warm coffee for 3 hrs. If you are looking for a perfect gift for mom,dad or wine lover, this wine tumbler with lid and straw is absolutely the best choice. They will love it for sure!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WNrDUXnGS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wedrink","source_asin":"B08Y8GFC6F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1039866","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y8GFC6F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y8GFC6F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
