window.products.push({"id":1039888,"name":"Divine Chef Professional Culinary Torch with adjustable flame and safety lock | Best torch for cooking Creme Brulee | Kitchen Blow Torch | Butane Cook","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811Lm8pvj8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Have you ever dreamt of making that gourmet dish you see chefs cooking on TV? Are you looking to wow your family and friends with dishes that look and taste like they are from top tier restaurants? The Divine Chef Culinary Torch is the perfect kitchen tool for helping you create gourmet dishes that will inspire! The Divine Chef Kitchen Torch is the perfect multi-use kitchen tool for professional and at home Chef's!  Show your family and friends a gourmet touch by: Caramelizing sugar atop Crème Brulee, Searing tuna to perfection, Glazing Honey over a Ham, Roasting Peppers and more!   Cooking Crème Brulee and other dishes has never been easier, our precision based flame controls makes your job easy as Pie!  Our Stainless Steel flame guard keeps your hand cool when the job gets hot, Safely cook at temperatures up to 2730 degrees without even breaking a sweat. Engineered with industrial grade materials for guaranteed performance time and time again. The Gas Supply Valve and Air Flow Control Valve allow for the desired burn with pin point accuracy. Turn the flame up for cooking and turn the flame down for lighting a candle… its that easy. Need both hands for a job? Our topple free base paired with our flame lock switch allows you to safely sit the torch on a flat surface and cook hands free. Non Slip rubber grip paired with a pistol grip ignition trigger makes for comfortable single handed operation. With an extra large fuel tank no job is too big for our torch. Up to 60 minutes of continuous burn time on one tank. (Butane Not Included)  As with all Divine Chef products it comes with a 3 year warranty and a money back guarantee. If you do not absolutely love our sensational high quality culinary torch, just return it we will refund every penny.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811Lm8pvj8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Divine Chef","source_asin":"B019WM22TI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1039888","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019WM22TI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019WM22TI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
